# UI / Frontend (Astro)

- Declarative, composable components; reuse existing UI patterns.
- Accessibility: semantic HTML, labels, keyboard nav, visible focus.
- Responsive by default (mobile → desktop).
- Match project styling conventions in `src/styles/` and colocated `<style>` blocks.
- Performance: lazy-load below-fold media, `preload` only true LCP assets, prefer `<picture>` with AVIF/WebP.
